    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TPG302 · Chapter 5 · Session 15</span>\n<h2>Session 15 — Practice 1 Designing a Book</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13667 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TPG302 · Chương 5 · Buổi 15</span>\n<h2>Buổi 15 — Practice 1 Designing a Book</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13667 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1<br>CLO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U,T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1<br>CLO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U,T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Practice 1 Designing a Book<br>Research + Individual Presentation</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Syllabus, Slide, Textbook, Reference</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>- Students can start with the simplest books: novels, memoirs, essays, and narrative nonfiction.Students are not allowed to choose a self-help book.<br>- Students research all the details inside and out of the book, then give the lecturer a short individual presentation.<br>- Time: 5-10 minutes per student<br><br>'INDIVIDUAL WORK<br>- Book construction: Each part of the book has its role to play and its assigned place in the whole.<br>- Cover design basics<br>- Fonts for text: There’s no bigger decision a designer makes than selecting the fonts that will be used for the book’s text.<br>- Fonts for display: Knowing how to choose and combine typefaces is critical for the designer.<br>- Architecture of the book page: Building pages and spreads is at the heart of book design.<br>- Non-text book elements: Every book incorporates elements that are outside the text itself, like notes, bibliographies, part- and chapter-opening pages, captions, sidebars, pull-quotes, and others. Each has to blend well with the rest of the book, and stand out when necessary.<br>- Minimum of 45 pages that included text.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
