    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TPG302 · Assessment 2/5</span>\n<h2>Group Present</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13667 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TPG302 · Đầu điểm 2/5</span>\n<h2>Group Present</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13667 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">in class and homework</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Slide presentation</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Group Present- Each group works on researching some specific products that will be used for Practice 1 and 2, such as book layout, magazine layout, brochure/leaflet/website layout, etc.- Research existing examples of the chosen layout type to identify best practices and potential weaknesses. Students deliver a slide presentation with full documentation of the research process (AI Use Log ) and present a counter-argument in Q&amp;A.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">The evaluation will consider the following criteria: Research plan &amp; sources (20%). Analysis &amp; findings (20%). Core making / prototyping (30%), Integration &amp; iteration (20%), Slides &amp; presentation (story + Q&amp;A) (10%). Students deliver a slide presentation with full documentation of the research process (AI Use Log) and present a counter-argument in Q&amp;A.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
